              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "غول — ghūl — \"an ogre, a ghoul\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خاف الأطفال من الغول في الحكاية. khāfa al-aṭfāl min al-ghūl fī al-ḥikāya. The children were scared of the ogre in the tale."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: غيلان, ghīlān."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "English ghoul is usually traced to this word."
            }
          ]
        },
