          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عملاق (ʿimlāq) is built on the four-letter root ʿ-m-l-q (Lane), where it is \"very tall\", and the ʿamāliqa are a people of old remembered as giants. Its origin before that is not settled."
